### Description
Yeni dosya `src/orchestra/monitor-adapter.ts` (~300 LoC). Spec'teki 3 adapter + factory:

```typescript
export interface WorkerInfo {
  id: string;
  status: string;
  createdAt?: string;
}

export interface ResourceUsage {
  cpu: string;
  memory: string;
  diskIo: string;
}

export interface MonitorAdapter {
  readonly backend: 'docker' | 'tmux' | 'subprocess';
  listActiveWorkers(): Promise<WorkerInfo[]>;
  captureWorkerOutput(workerId: string, lines: number): Promise<string | null>;
  getResourceUsage(workerId: string): Promise<ResourceUsage | null>;
  killWorker(workerId: string): Promise<void>;
}

export class DockerMonitorAdapter implements MonitorAdapter { ... }
export class TmuxMonitorAdapter implements MonitorAdapter { ... }
export class SubprocessMonitorAdapter implements MonitorAdapter { ... }

export function createMonitorAdapter(config: ResolvedConfig): MonitorAdapter {
  switch (config.spawn_backend) {
    case 'docker': return new DockerMonitorAdapter();
    case 'tmux': return new TmuxMonitorAdapter();
    case 'subprocess': return new SubprocessMonitorAdapter();
    default: throw new Error(`Unknown backend: ${config.spawn_backend}`);
  }
}
```

Implementation detayları spec'teki Bash command'lar:
- DockerAdapter: `docker ps --filter name=deckent-w-`, `docker logs --tail`, `docker stats --no-stream`, `docker kill`
- TmuxAdapter: `tmux ls -F`, `tmux capture-pane -t -p -S`, `tmux kill-session`
- SubprocessAdapter: `.deckent/workers/*.pid` glob, ps -o, kill

Subprocess `captureWorkerOutput` placeholder döner: `"(subprocess backend: stdout not captured ...)"`.

### Test (10+ test, contract test her adapter için)
1. createMonitorAdapter(docker) → DockerMonitorAdapter instance
2. createMonitorAdapter(tmux) → TmuxMonitorAdapter
3. createMonitorAdapter(subprocess) → SubprocessMonitorAdapter
4. Unknown backend → throw
5-10. Her adapter için listActiveWorkers + captureWorkerOutput + killWorker contract testi (mock exec)
11. Subprocess captureWorkerOutput placeholder string döner
12. Tmux getResourceUsage null döner

**Kanıt:** `npx vitest run tests/orchestra/monitor-adapter.test.ts` 10+/10+ PASS, manual: live docker sprint + `createMonitorAdapter(config).listActiveWorkers()` REPL'de container listesi.

